:: Garden Check 3 [GARDEN] {"position":"1700,1150","size":"100,100"}
!!Your sustainability score is ''$sustainabilityScore''. Input it below to build your city

<iframe src="https://editor.p5js.org/arihamm24/full/zj6Mt624-" width="800" height="650"></iframe>

<<do>>
	<<if $sustainabilityScore >= 10>>
    	You made the most sustainable choices over the course of your life. From your relationships, to your community, to your career and education, you made choices to better inform your decisions about sustainability and interactions with your environment. This ultimately allowed you to have a positive sustainable impact.
    <<else>>
    	You could've made better choices during your life, but that's likely true of most people. Whether it was a moment of selfishness at the expense of community, a choice of convenience over connection, or apathy amongst a passionate people, you made choices that ultimately limited your view of sustainability and opportunities to build a sustainable world.
    <</if>>
