:: One Year Later [Young-Adult] {"position":"1500,925","size":"100,100"}
You're on a first date at a local bookstore. Between the two of you, you've amassed a stack of books 3 feet high and a light-hearted, but informative rapport.

You check out at the register, and you thank your date for paying. 

//Generous//, you think, //a good sign...//

You sit together on a couch in one of the store's reading nooks. You've discussed all you can about your books without actually //reading// them, and the conversation turns to simple, but amorous small talk. 

"What do you do?" they ask

<<do>>
	<<if $college>>
		<<link "I’m currently attending college as a(n) $major major.""Person response">><</link>>
     <<elseif $work>>
        <<if $sustainabilityScore >=5>>
        	<<set $power to "solar">>
            <<set $sustainabilityScore += 2>>
            <<else>>
            <<set $power to "coal">>
            <<set $sustainabilityScore -= 2>>
        <</if>>
       <<link "I’m working at the city $power plant.""Person response">><</link>>
     <<elseif $major == "art" && !$college>>
     	[[I'm a volunteer art teacher. Skipped college and started working in afterschool programs a few months ago|Person response][$sustainabilityScore += 1]]
     <<elseif $major == "health" && !$college>>
     [[I volunteer with the local clinic a few times a week, but I never went to college|Person response][$sustainabilityScore += 3]]
     <</if>>
     
     
<</do>>


:: Person response [mini-scene Young-Adult] {"position":"1500,1025","size":"100,100"}
"Wow!" they exclaim. "That's...impressive. I don't work much myself. Just odd jobs here and there to finance my book addiction when the library's closed. Oh and to pay for dates with cuties like you"

You laugh, as you have been all evening, and blush a bit. 

//They're **funny**//, you think. //And flirty//


An alarm goes off on their phone, and you both jump, startled out of very nice moment.

"Speaking of," they say, "I have to go fix my neighbor's car. I totally lost track of time"


[[Time to go|Marriage]]


